  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "How do I play City Parking Jam?",
      "a": "Tap on any car to make it move forward in its facing direction. If the path to the exit is clear, it drives out. If blocked, it bumps and recoils."
    },
    {
      "q": "What are the vehicle types?",
      "a": "Sedans (1x2) are fast and nimble, SUVs (1x2) have standard speed, and Delivery Vans (1x3) are long and require wider lanes to exit."
    },
    {
      "q": "How many levels are available?",
      "a": "City Parking Jam features 30 distinct levels with increasing grid sizes and obstacles like traffic cones, barriers, and fire hydrants."
    },
    {
      "q": "How do I unlock new skins and trails?",
      "a": "Earn stars by completing levels within the par moves limit. Use earned stars in the Garage to unlock new liveries like Taxi, Police Patrol, and Cyberpunk Neon."
    }
